{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-25","kind":"proposition","title":"铰链定理逆命题：对边越长，夹角越大","englishTitle":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, but have the base greater than the base, they will also have the one of the angles contained by the equal straight lines greater than the other.","book":1,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","contentId":"euclid-1-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c9325e8d4f03be51153fbb18d0dccdbe2c6fe56a4fa7ed0508d85bfc01cd3ca","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-25.statement","euclid-1-25.construction.1","euclid-1-25.proof.1","euclid-1-25.proof.2","euclid-1-25.proof.3","euclid-1-25.proof.4","euclid-1-25.proof.5","euclid-1-25.proof.6","euclid-1-25.conclusion","euclid-1-25.historical.1","euclid-1-25.historical.2","euclid-1-25.historical.3","euclid-1-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"713f16531483a8dec67dd838ac7f5aed3cf5ca09162630ad982de24660f1c1a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, but have the base greater than the base, they will also have the one of the angles contained by the equal straight lines greater than the other."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形的两边分别等于两边,但底边比底边大,它们也将具有由等直线组成的角度之一,大于另一角度。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形相当之两腰各等若一形之底大则腰间角亦大"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"当两个三角形相等且两条腿相等时，如果一个图形的底边较大，则腿之间的角也较大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39ffe5e9e9f1242efb8794ec975a738074e455a30763edc4fd4e3915a6d14db2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having the two sides AB, AC equal to the two sides DE, DF respectively, namely AB to DE, and AC to DF; and let the base BC be greater than the base EF;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF成为两个三角,双方的AB、AC和DE等值分别是DE、DF,即AB至DE和AC至DF;让底边、BC的三角大于底边和EF;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae17040b3cfcad07f52be488467bb2f6f7126412d059e2ef7468e88b681b32ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle BAC is also greater than the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,BAC角度也大于EDF角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"220daae767d363db66c1b0b44203ad672eb47f98b411bef39f38e1685b1acd0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, it is either equal to it or less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是,它要么等于它,要么低于它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b6f19d1d73c300f81320a95a75108cf7d1a31f75446fb991b544d614f265321","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the angle BAC is not equal to the angle EDF; for then the base BC would also have been equal to the base EF, [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] but it is not; therefore the angle BAC is not equal to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BAC角度与EDF角度不相等;底边、BC角度也等于底边、EF,但并非如此;因此,BAC角度与EDF角度不相等。（相关点与线段：BC、EF） [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c93a8513083694d3e704f6817d4038fc96af75886cc9405e997d6da43e13c25","citations":["euclid-1-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Neither again is the angle BAC less than the angle EDF; for then the base BC would also have been less than the base EF, [[I. 24](/principles/euclid-1-24)] but it is not; therefore the angle BAC is not less than the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度BAC也低于角度EDF;因为底边 BC也低于角度底边 EF,但并非如此;因此角度BAC不低于角度EDF。 [[I. 24](/principles/euclid-1-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20c75c4600576ed9f4c6122238f239758192969c3516490b44b0731801cc4bb4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that it is not equal either; therefore the angle BAC is greater than the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,两者不相等;因此,BAC角大于EDF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"711789b079f53ae3a18a4cec74f71ece00a84ad7aada22e74b80d4c6f3a35b08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形相当之两腰各等若一形之底大则腰间角亦大"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"当两个三角形相等且两条腿相等时，如果一个图形的底边较大，则腿之间的角也较大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1842fcbb71f589725b01a7147b0b1185ad45620a4a16d2fd1d59aab3b183dc38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙与丁戊己两角形其甲乙与丁戊甲丙与丁巳各两腰等若乙丙底大于戊巳底题言乙甲丙角大于戊丁巳角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙 和 丁戊己 是两个三角形，甲乙、丁戊甲丙 和 丁巳 各自的腿相等。如果 乙丙 的底边大于，则 乙甲丙 的底边大于 戊丁巳 的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4d40b62f101ab0cc25bc409975450a430fda36f733ab288c34bf4c4ec5d77c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然令言或小或等若言等则两形之两腰各等腰间角又等宜两底亦等〈本篇四〉何设乙丙底大也若言乙甲丙角小则对乙甲丙角之乙丙线宜亦小〈本篇廿四〉何设乙丙底大也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果说情况相反，则设它小于或等于；如果说相等，那么两个图形的两条边相等，并且边之间的角也应相等。〈本篇四〉，为什么要把乙丙的底边设得更大？如果说角乙甲丙较小，那么角乙甲丙的乙丙线也应较小。〈本篇廿四〉，为什么要把乙丙的底边设定？"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-25.source","contentId":"euclid-1-25","revisionId":"euclid-1-25@raw-5c9325e8d4f03be5","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e24caa14611d49d3fe12ddc3168e0337423e9dbc6c2977ad9977bbe88607495d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/r